{"id":"passagier","lemma":"Passagier","pos":"noun","rank":3244,"glosses":["passenger (especially of a plane or ship, but applicable to all transport)"],"ipa":"/ˌpasaˈʒiːɐ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/94/De-Passagier.ogg/De-Passagier.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Passagiers","plural":"Passagiere","feminine":"Passagierin"},"examples":[{"text":"Sind alle Passagiere an Bord?","en":"Are all passengers on board?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"all, everyone"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"aboard, on board"]]},{"text":"Einer der Passagiere wurde verletzt.","en":"One of the passengers was injured.","words":[{"g":"a / one","l":"ein"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"hurt, injured"}]},{"text":"Wie viele Passagiere wurden gerettet?","en":"How many passengers were rescued?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"to save, to rescue","l":"retten"}]},{"text":"Waren viele Passagiere im Zug?","en":"Were there many passengers on the train?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},null,{"g":"in the"},{"g":"train"}]},{"text":"Einige der Passagiere wurden schwer verletzt.","en":"A few of the passengers were seriously injured.","words":[{"g":"united","l":"einig"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"heavy, weighty"},{"g":"hurt, injured"}]}]}